cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Seedling"
abstract: >-
  Modular, multi-stage literature-review pipeline that grows a reviewed corpus
  from a handful of seed papers: BERTopic clustering, deterministic Scopus/arXiv
  retrieval, a researcher-weighted hybrid relevance scorer over seven explicit
  signals, coverage-probe recall and BERTopic membership verification, and an
  optional frozen, manifest-tracked snapshot for exact reproduction.
type: software
